{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n法式炒帶子/炸牛油雞/芝士牛仔肉\n</p>\n<h2>跑馬地Amigo五道菜懷舊餐單</h2>\n<p>跑馬地Amigo (雅谷餐廳)由 1967 年開業至今，是香港飲食界為人知曉的歷史傳奇，而適逢 Amigo 邁向 60 周年，由即日起至 11 月 30 日， 逢星期一至星期四晚市時段，推出期間限定的「5 道菜穿梭 1967 懷舊菜單」，每位$980，歎盡前菜、湯品、主菜和甜品。凡惠顧此菜單的每位食客，更可以 1967 年餐牌所記載的昔日價格 (每款$21 至 $28) 追加享用 1 款闊別已久的 entrée 菜式！</p>\n<h2>五款可供追加$21起Amigo名饌</h2>\n<p>5 款可供追加的 entrée 菜式是當年大受歡迎的 Amigo 名饌。當中包括有炸牛油雞卷 ($23)、芝士牛仔肉 ($25)、太子酥盒 ($21)、紙 包魚柳 ($26)及法式炒帶子 ($28)。 特別推介芝士牛仔肉，選用去骨小牛肉片作為基底， 包裹著帶有煙燻香氣的火腿，以及瑞士艾曼塔芝士或格呂耶爾芝士，再配上意大利芝士雪糕，外層酥脆、內裏香滑軟心。</p>\n<p>AMIGO (雅谷餐廳)<br/>\n地址: 跑馬地黃泥涌道 79 號 A<br/>\n電話:<a>2577 2202</a> / 2577 8993<br/>\n備註：《5 道菜穿梭 1967 懷舊菜單》由即日起至 2026 年 11 月 30 日， 逢星期一 至 星期四, 晚市時段 6pm-11pm<br>\n價錢: 每位$980 (另收加一服務費)<br/>\n官方IG：@amigorestaurant_hk</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243509945715_15644414456af94a839ce83.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243509945715_15644414456af94a839ce83.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243730156008_20885466276af94a85cb327.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243730156008_20885466276af94a85cb327.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243917513066_1800677126af94a877c0dc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472243917513066_1800677126af94a877c0dc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244070160782_21273269426af94a891567d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244070160782_21273269426af94a891567d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244240580781_3604831406af94a8aca594.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244240580781_3604831406af94a8aca594.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244420137517_2916007446af94a8c9f84d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244420137517_2916007446af94a8c9f84d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244615561736_14942966636af94a8e86257.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179472244615561736_14942966636af94a8e86257.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfv0ZwEjjfB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.278077+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none",